---
import SectionLabel from "./SectionLabel.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="py-section-y">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <SectionLabel number="01" label="About" class="mb-8" />

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-8 md:gap-12">
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-display-lg font-display font-bold tracking-display text-on-surface leading-[1.1] mb-6 wrap-break-word">
          From <span class="text-surface-tint">mods</span> to<br />
          full-stack — building<br />
          at every scale
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
          <p>
            My passion for development began with Minecraft modding, where I learned the fundamentals of
            coding and problem-solving. Over time, I transitioned into web development, expanding my skill
            set to build scalable and efficient applications.
          </p>
          <p>
            Today, I combine my technical expertise with a creative mindset to deliver impactful solutions —
            from full-stack web applications using React, Next.js, and Spring Boot, to Minecraft mods
            built with Fabric that have reached 100,000+ downloads.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-2 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 px-5 py-4 rounded bg-surface-container/60 border border-surface-container-high">
          <span class="node shrink-0"></span>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface">100K+</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-mono tracking-label-mono">Mod Downloads</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 px-5 py-4 rounded bg-surface-container/60 border border-surface-container-high">
          <span class="node shrink-0"></span>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface">2+</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-mono tracking-label-mono">Years Experience</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 px-5 py-4 rounded bg-surface-container/60 border border-surface-container-high">
          <span class="node shrink-0"></span>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface">Full-Stack</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-mono tracking-label-mono">Web &amp; Modding</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
